Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:01:59.15,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}萨巴伦卡 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}5 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}2{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 佩古拉 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.58,0:00:05.74,EN,,0,0,0,,Aryna, that was a flawless performance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.58,0:00:05.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,阿丽娜 今晚这场太完美了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:11.58,EN,,0,0,0,,by you tonight No complaints,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:11.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,挑不出一点毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:13.62,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm just super happy that I was able
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:13.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,我特别开心 自己能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.62,0:00:16.60,EN,,0,0,0,,to pull out such tennis Last match I played
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.62,0:00:16.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,打出这样的球 上一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:18.24,EN,,0,0,0,,against Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:18.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我对上杰西卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:19.90,EN,,0,0,0,,It was almost impossible for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:19.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,那场球我几乎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.90,0:00:20.54,EN,,0,0,0,,to get the win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.90,0:00:20.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,赢不下来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:21.78,EN,,0,0,0,,So I'm super happy that I was able
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:21.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.78,0:00:25.22,EN,,0,0,0,,to Play such tennis in front of you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.78,0:00:25.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,能在你们面前打出这样的球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:26.78,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you for thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:26.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.78,0:00:27.50,EN,,0,0,0,,for the atmosphere
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.78,0:00:27.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢这样的气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:34.27,EN,,0,0,0,,and honestly guys you You're the best
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:34.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,说真的 各位 你们太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.27,0:00:36.65,EN,,0,0,0,,your respect to me is priceless
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.27,0:00:36.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们给我的尊重 千金不换
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.65,0:00:38.67,EN,,0,0,0,,and I really appreciate that you I know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.65,0:00:38.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很感激 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:40.27,EN,,0,0,0,,that you wanted her to win It's obvious,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:40.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们本来希望她赢 这很明显
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:42.31,EN,,0,0,0,,but thank you for being so respectful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:42.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,但还是谢谢你们这样尊重我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:49.43,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Love you guys What
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:49.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢 爱你们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.43,0:00:51.29,EN,,0,0,0,,felt different about this match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.43,0:00:51.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场球和上一场有什么不同
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.29,0:00:52.99,EN,,0,0,0,,and how were you able to play
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.29,0:00:52.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:55.71,EN,,0,0,0,,so well for the entirety of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:55.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,整场都保持这个水准的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.71,0:00:57.21,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I was so desperate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.71,0:00:57.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我太想赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:00:59.01,EN,,0,0,0,,to win. I wanted it badly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:00:59.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是特别想 特别特别想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.01,0:01:00.75,EN,,0,0,0,,and I was just trying to focus on myself
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.01,0:01:00.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,我只是努力专注在自己身上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.75,0:01:02.15,EN,,0,0,0,,and then guys look
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.75,0:01:02.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有 各位 你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.15,0:01:04.41,EN,,0,0,0,,at my box. I couldn't fail in front
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.15,0:01:04.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,看看我的包厢 我不能输
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.41,0:01:07.23,EN,,0,0,0,,of all of those Legends beautiful girls
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.41,0:01:07.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,在那些传奇 那些漂亮姑娘面前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.23,0:01:09.81,EN,,0,0,0,,the best people and my team of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.23,0:01:09.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,最好的人 当然还有我的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.81,0:01:11.81,EN,,0,0,0,,I love you guys Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.81,0:01:11.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,我爱你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.81,0:01:13.55,EN,,0,0,0,,you're into your fourth straight US
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.81,0:01:13.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,你连续第四次闯进美网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:16.23,EN,,0,0,0,,Open final you've done this a few times
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:16.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,这件事你已经做过好几回了
