Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.23,0:01:18.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,你有什么固定的仪式吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.19,0:01:20.43,EN,,0,0,0,,to do before the final here in New York
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.19,0:01:20.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,在纽约打决赛之前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.43,0:01:22.51,EN,,0,0,0,,or are you gonna keep it the same?
