Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.51,0:01:23.41,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.51,0:01:23.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,有 当然有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.41,0:01:25.31,EN,,0,0,0,,I have my favorite breakfast
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.41,0:01:25.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,我有我最爱的那顿早餐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.31,0:01:27.47,EN,,0,0,0,,I have my dinner the dinner
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.31,0:01:27.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有那顿晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.47,0:01:29.61,EN,,0,0,0,,that has to be done even like last
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.47,0:01:29.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,那顿是雷打不动的 就像昨晚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.61,0:01:31.29,EN,,0,0,0,,night Polo Bar they had private event,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.61,0:01:31.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,Polo Bar 本来有私人包场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.29,0:01:34.03,EN,,0,0,0,,but Just because I have my ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.29,0:01:34.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,但就因为我有我的仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.03,0:01:35.01,EN,,0,0,0,,They really squeezed me in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.03,0:01:35.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们硬是给我挤出了位置
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.01,0:01:36.13,EN,,0,0,0,,and I felt like I really broke
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.01,0:01:36.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,我都觉得自己是闯进了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.13,0:01:37.29,EN,,0,0,0,,into someone else's night,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.13,0:01:37.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,别人的场子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.29,0:01:39.19,EN,,0,0,0,,but thank you. Thank you for Polo Bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.29,0:01:39.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,但真的谢谢 谢谢 Polo Bar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.19,0:01:41.19,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you Nelly for squeezing us in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.19,0:01:41.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢他们给我挤出时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.19,0:01:43.65,EN,,0,0,0,,My routine really means a lot to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.19,0:01:43.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,我这套流程对我真的很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.65,0:01:45.95,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, I definitely got some
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.65,0:01:45.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以是的 我一定照办
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.95,0:01:48.45,EN,,0,0,0,,We'll allow you to start your routine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.95,0:01:48.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,那现在就让你去走你的流程
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.45,0:01:50.39,EN,,0,0,0,,done tonight looking forward to seeing you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.45,0:01:50.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚打得漂亮 决赛见
